<view class="page">
  <view class="van-card padded">
    <view class="title">问题反馈</view>
    <view class="muted">发现店铺、菜品、评分或页面问题，都可以在这里反馈。紧急问题可发邮件到 admin@deceric.site。</view>
    <view class="field">
      <view class="field-label">标题</view>
      <view class="field-example">例如：北食堂某店铺关门、页面按钮挡住了</view>
      <input class="input" data-key="title" value="{{title}}" bindinput="bindInput" placeholder="填写标题" />
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <view class="field-label">具体问题或建议</view>
      <view class="field-example">说清楚位置、页面或你希望怎么改</view>
      <textarea class="textarea" data-key="content" value="{{content}}" bindinput="bindInput" placeholder="填写具体内容" />
    </view>
    <view class="submit-wrap">
      <van-button round type="primary" loading="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">提交反馈</van-button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
